        "scenario-scaffold#gwt-reports-missing-steps-and-placeholders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "turns": "large",
      "title": "slice-gate.py：warm 预热全量写成本 change 旧基线（沿用最近 change 的 gate.test 与包装脚本、分层仓库跳过）、baseline 等待预热、lint 判 scaffold 占位",
      "packet": "slices/S3.md",
      "owns": [
        "template/.claude/hooks/slice-gate.py",
        "tests/test_baseline_warm.py",
        "tests/test_lint_placeholder.py"
