        "baseline-warm#warm-skips-tiered-repo",
        "baseline-warm#baseline-reuses-warm-when-only-tests-changed",
        "baseline-warm#baseline-waits-for-running-warm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "title": "propose 命令与 skill 改用工具链（warm → instructions → packets → scaffold → fork 补断言 → gwt → tasks → lint → pin），规划期派发只允许 fork",
